animation_notes: |
  ## Cinematic Simulation Prompt — 07: Tier 1 Foundation Layer

  **SCENE 1 — "The Awakening" (0:00–0:06)**
  Camera: Static center-frame. Environment: Absolute dark-blue vacuum (#0a0e27).
  A high-resolution CORTEX logo (cortex-docs/assets/images/cortex-logo-512.png) fades in,
  centered on a ray-traced glassmorphism floor. An 'electric-aura' animation ignites —
  concentric cyan (#00d4ff) and purple (#7b61ff) pulse-glows radiate outward, reflecting
  off the polished glass surface. Volumetric blue fog at floor level. Hold 4s.
  Logo shrinks to bottom-right watermark (15% opacity).

  **SCENE 2 — "FPV Drone Dive: The Stable Core" (0:06–0:16)**
  Camera: FPV drone dives from the logo through volumetric fog, descending to the
  lowest level of the CORTEX architecture — Tier 1 Foundation. Four frosted
  glassmorphism blocks materialize as the bedrock platform, each rendered in
  Deep Cobalt (#1a1f3a) with Midnight Blue (#0a0e27) edges:
  - "Validators" — cyan (#00d4ff) neon filaments pulse inside (schema validation, type checking).
  - "Exception Hierarchy" — cyan filaments (CortexError, ValidationError).
  - "File Operations" — cyan filaments (safe I/O, path abstractions).
  - "Structured Logging" — cyan filaments (correlation IDs, context propagation).
  All four blocks sit on a shared glassmorphism platform — the immutable foundation.
  A "Lidar Blue" laser sweep scans across all four blocks simultaneously, confirming
  structural integrity. Ray-traced reflections cascade off the glass floor. Background
  blur: 20px refraction on all surfaces.

  **SCENE 3 — "Extensions Grow Above" (0:16–0:30)**
  Camera: Slow dolly upward. Dependent modules materialize one at a time ABOVE the
  foundation — Models, Config, Storage, Infrastructure — each as a frosted glass capsule
  with purple (#7b61ff) neon filaments (higher-tier intelligence). Dependency arrows
  render as bioluminescent neon conduits connecting each dependent module down to its
  foundation block. Each arrow leaves a persistent light-trail.
  Key message materializes as a glassmorphism info-pill floating center-frame:
  "Extend, Don't Fork — this layer never changes" in Space Grotesk Bold, cyan text
  on dark pill background (rgba(10, 14, 39, 0.85)). The foundation blocks pulse with
  a steady, confident cyan heartbeat — emphasizing stability.

  **SCENE 4 — "Extension Points" (0:30–0:40)**
  Camera: Pulls back to a wide shot. Seven extension point capsules materialize in a
  semicircle above the dependent modules — each a frosted glass node with unique neon
  filament colors (matching their domain). Dendrite-like neon connections grow outward
  from the stable core, reaching the extension points. The foundation blocks remain
  rock-solid at the bottom — no movement, no change — while the extensions above
  animate with growth energy.

  **SCENE 5 — "Orbital Reveal" (0:40–0:50)**
  Camera: 360-degree orbital pan around the complete Foundation + Dependents + Extensions
  architecture. Foundation blocks glow steady cyan. Extension points pulse with varied
  domain colors. Volumetric fog swirls at the base. Ray-traced reflections cascade
  across every glass surface. Camera completes orbit, pulls back.
  Architecture fades to 40%. Glassmorphism "Evidence Bundle" icon materializes
  center-frame — sealed document with cyan checkmark — fades to black.
